OL,5,G1600 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FDrink-driving, drug use and
OL,7,     Fatrocious weather all contribute
OL,8,     Fto cases for the Traffic Cops,
OL,9,     Fincluding one coke-snorting driver
OL,10,     Fwho gets arrested twice in quick
OL,11,     Fsuccession.
OL,12,G1700 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FPolice intercept units on patrol.
OL,14,     FRob and Dan pursue of an
OL,15,     Funder-powered runaway hatchback
OL,16,     Fbefore the suspect decamps and
OL,17,     Fmakes a run for it - in a
OL,18,     Ffluorescent jacket!
