OL,5,G1800 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FLisa and Lewis tackle a
OL,7,     Ftroublesome lad with a potty
OL,8,     Fmouth, followed by a trip to the
OL,9,     Fcanal, where a member of the
OL,10,     Fpublic has heard gunshots.
OL,11,G1900 Police Interceptors
OL,12,     FReality series following
OL,13,     Fhigh-speed police intercept units.
OL,14,     FThe interceptors assemble in
OL,15,     Fpursuit of a BMW with no
OL,16,     Finsurance, no tax and a suspected
OL,17,     Fbanned driver behind the wheel.
OL,18,G2000 Police Interceptors
OL,19,     FRon and Spence race to a scene of
OL,20,     Fan alleged knife attack.
