OL,5,G2100 Trauma Room One
OL,6,     FA patient is sped into theatre
OL,7,     Fafter a devastating stroke. Lorna
OL,8,     Fis rushed in for emergency surgery
OL,9,     Fafter breaking her back. A
OL,10,     Fconsultant neurosurgeon must act
OL,11,     Fquickly to avoid paralysis. (Ep5)
OL,12,G2200 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FAfter a woman suffers cardiac
OL,14,     Farrest while driving, paramedics
OL,15,     Fmust induce a coma at the roadside
OL,16,     Fto save her. Meanwhile, a
OL,17,     F19-year-old suffers critical
OL,18,     Finjuries in a motorcycle crash.
