OL,5,G2300 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FParamedics rush to help a
OL,7,     F67-year-old HGV driver who has
OL,8,     Fsuffered a cardiac arrest, and, in
OL,9,     FHillingdon, a man who has suffered
OL,10,     Fsevere burns after lighting a
OL,11,     Fbonfire with petrol.
OL,12,G0000 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FAfter being run over by a car, Sue
OL,14,     Farrives with spinal and head
OL,15,     Finjuries. Ethan starts to show
OL,16,     Fsigns of severe memory loss after
OL,17,     Fbanging his head at the skate
OL,18,     Fpark.
